# U-Boot's environment for fw_printenv/fw_setenv (RAUC's U-Boot backend): the
# redundant raw copies on the microSD, in the gap before the first partition,
# as res/uboot/pb2-ab-env.sh sets CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET / ENV_OFFSET_REDUND.
# MMC device   offset     env size
/dev/mmcblk1   0x80000    0x1f000
/dev/mmcblk1   0xc0000    0x1f000
